    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Aforo y permanencia en ROI",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Aforo por zona",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sv_zona_presentes{motor=\"deepfrigate\",camera=\"$camera\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{zona}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "La línea roja es el umbral de overcrowding configurado en config/zones.json."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Permanencia en ROI (por visita)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sv_zona_permanencia_max_s{motor=\"deepfrigate\",camera=\"$camera\"}",
          "legendFormat": "máx · {{zona}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sv_zona_permanencia_media_s{motor=\"deepfrigate\",camera=\"$camera\"}",
          "legendFormat": "media · {{zona}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "gradientMode": "none"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "máx · area_cajas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "media · area_cajas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Tiempo dentro del polígono, por visita. NO es `end_time - start_time` de un Event de Frigate, que es la duración del track: eso está en \"Events más largos\", abajo. Dos cantidades distintas."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Zonas, líneas y dirección",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Overcrowding: estado",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "df_overcrowding_state{motor=\"deepfrigate\",camera=\"$camera\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{zona}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.9,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "normal",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "overcrowding",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Estado con histéresis: entra en `count >= 4`, sale en `count <= 2`, y el cambio tiene que aguantar 10 s. Antes, con flanco desnudo en `count >= 4`, el aforo oscilando entre 3 y 4 producía ~14 flancos cada 10 min, un Event de Frigate cada uno. Los 10 s salen de muestrear el aforo a 1 Hz: los bajones por debajo del umbral de salida duraron 8 s."
    },
